        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kTdCtwfVsV9W7eiXD2es-107" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;613&quot; data-end=&quot;648&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;One user can make many bookings&lt;/strong&gt;, but a booking belongs to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;675&quot; data-end=&quot;687&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;one user&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="1710" x="-1890" y="-9380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kTdCtwfVsV9W7eiXD2es-108" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;Each hall has &lt;strong data-start=&quot;806&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;many availability slots&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;A hall can be booked many times.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;A single time slot (e.g., Morning, Evening) can belong to many availability slots.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;A booking uses exactly &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1257&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;one time slot&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;A booking selects exactly &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1431&quot; data-end=&quot;1456&quot;&gt;one availability slot&lt;/strong&gt;, but a slot may appear in many bookings over time.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;Each booking has exactly &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1656&quot; data-end=&quot;1674&quot;&gt;one event type&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Wedding, Birthday).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;A menu has multiple items.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;A booking can select exactly &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1949&quot; data-end=&quot;1969&quot;&gt;one menu package&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;Each payment has exactly one method.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;A booking can have &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2246&quot; data-end=&quot;2270&quot;&gt;one or many payments&lt;/strong&gt; (advance payment)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;ADMIN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;A user can create many bookings&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;Admin manages halls 1 - M&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;Admin creates/approves events. 1-M&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;Admin reviews/approves/cancels bookings 1 - M&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;Admin verifies/refunds payments 1-M&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;Admin views customer accounts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 38px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="2420" width="1910" x="-2490" y="-9130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
